    "description": "Original MCQs for a German workplace-compliance training module on whistleblower protection (Hinweisgeberschutzgesetz / HinSchG), in force since 2 July 2023, covering scope/thresholds for internal reporting channels, the mechanics of internal and external Meldestellen (§12-13, §16-17 HinSchG), confidentiality and documentation duties, protection against retaliation and the reversed burden of proof (§36 HinSchG), and the administrative fines (Bußgeld) under the Act. Content is independently phrased and grounded directly in the HinSchG statute text, NOT sourced or paraphrased from any commercial compliance-training vendor's catalog. This is a fully independent exam module from Fuehrerschein (Klasse B), Angelschein, LKW, Motorrad, and Datenschutz - separate content pool, separate exam simulation. Scaled from 20 to 40 questions (DN-50 follow-up, 4 new questions per existing topic, same pattern DN-48 used for the other 4 compliance modules) - now above the 30-question Exam Simulation floor.",
